        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Revise the club's budget so that the next plan includes the things the first plan forgot. Use the words planned, actual, surplus, deficit.' Give 6 minutes of silent work, then 2 minutes of pair checking. WAIT TIME 10 seconds after asking: 'What would you change before the next open day?' Cold-call 3 learners. Ensure that the model shows the 2,630 gap, the 2,370 surplus, and the 1,515 deficit against the guide's fee. Record on the class model: 'Planned budget missed discount and commission, so actual surplus (2,370) was 2,630 less than planned (5,000).'",
