        "teacherMoves": "Draw the model on the board with learners and ask them to copy it. Say: \"Complete this sentence in your notebook: the cash box was less than the budget partly because ...\" WAIT TIME 15 seconds. Cold-call 3 learners to read their sentences. Then ask each to complete a quick exit check on a slip: a shirt marked KES 350 sells for KES 315; state the discount and the percentage discount (35 and 10%). Collect the slips. Allow about 6 minutes for this phase.",
        "sensemakingStrategy": "Cumulative model revision: the lesson's idea is added to the class model as a labelled step with numbers. A 'still unexplained' box makes the limits of the current model visible and motivates the next lesson.",
