    "teacherReflection": "1. How many learners worked out the percentage discount using the marked price as the base, and who used the selling price instead? What would you change to fix that?\n2. Did the role play make the discount and selling price clearer, or did some learners focus on acting rather than calculating?\n3. Did learners correctly say that the discounts explain KES 2,000 of the KES 2,630 gap and not all of it? What evidence did you hear?\n4. Which reasons for giving a discount did learners offer, and how could you build on them in Lesson 4?\n5. Which questions on the Driving Question Board show learners are ready for commission?",
